      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The area that is now Ryan was part of an unorganized Delaware County territory until the 1850s, when township organization followed Iowa's 1846 statehood.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/ryan_iowa",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Ryan was officially incorporated in 1901, marking its transition from a settlement to an incorporated city.",
